<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Word Master</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f5f5f5;
    color: #222;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

body.dark {
    background: #121212;
    color: white;
}

.container {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 20px;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

.dark .card {
    background: #1e1e1e;
}

h1 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: gray;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 16px;
}

button {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #4a6cff;
    color: white;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-top: 8px;
}

button:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
}

.menu button {
    background: #333;
}

.dark .menu button {
    background: #444;
}

.hidden {
    display: none;
}

.stats {
    line-height: 1.8;
}

.message {
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 10px;
}

</style>
</head>


<body>

<div class="container">


<div class="card" id="loginBox">

<h1>Word Master</h1>

<div class="subtitle">
Remember More, Forget Less.
</div>

<input 
id="passwordInput"
type="password"
maxlength="4"
placeholder="4자리 비밀번호">

<button onclick="login()">
시작하기
</button>

</div>



<div id="app" class="hidden">


<div class="card">

<h1>Word Master</h1>

<div class="subtitle">
Remember More, Forget Less.
</div>

</div>


<div class="card stats">

오늘의 목표 : 30문제

<br>

<span id="progress">
0 / 30
</span>

<hr>

전체 정답률 :
<span id="accuracy">
0%
</span>

<br>

전체 단어 :
<span id="wordCount">
0개
</span>

<br>

암기 완료 :
<span id="completeCount">
0개
</span>


</div>


<div class="card menu">

<button onclick="startQuiz()">
퀴즈 시작
</button>

<button onclick="addWord()">
단어 추가
</button>

<button onclick="toggleDark()">
다크 모드
</button>


</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="message" id="quote">

"5문제만 풀어도 괜찮아요."

</div>

</div>


</div>


</div>
